<title>GERMANY: VEW H1 group net profit up 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>VEW H1 group net profit up 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   109     up 8.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,319   down 0.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German electricity utility is Vereinigte Elektrizitaetswerke Westfalen AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
